    "text": "By James Gemmell ,\n1 days ago GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. -- The Kent County Animal Shelter is nearing capacity. The county administrator's office says there are only a handful of kennels available. It says you can help by adopting or reclaiming lost pets as quickly as possible. Dog adoption fees are $70 and include vaccinations, a microchip,... Read full article\n2",
